			"notes": "# MieHex:Revolution 1.0.4+1.21.1\n\n**Minecraft 1.21.1 · NeoForge + Fabric**\n\n## 中文\n\n这是 **MieHex:Revolution 的首个 Minecraft 1.21.1 版本**，同时提供 NeoForge 与 Fabric 两个平台的 jar。\n\n### 版本内容\n\n- 移植至 Minecraft 1.21.1 / Hex Casting `0.12.0-devel-pre-64`\n- 适配 Hex Casting 0.12 的 `CastingImage` 变更：移除了 `userData`，改用 `ImageComponentType` 组件保存每次施法的导入映射与原始图案标志\n- 依赖 PAUCAL `0.7.1-pre-27+1.21.1`\n- 基于 Architectury 多平台工程（common + neoforge + fabric）\n- 配置界面使用 Cloth Config（NeoForge 15.0.140 / Fabric 15.0.140）\n- NeoForge 端需要 Kotlin for Forge 与 Caelus（Hex Casting 的依赖）\n\n### 安装\n\n1. 选择对应平台的 jar：\n   - `miehex_revolution-neoforge-1.21.1-1.0.4+1.21.1.jar` → NeoForge 21.1.x\n   - `miehex_revolution-fabric-1.21.1-1.0.4+1.21.1.jar` → Fabric Loader 0.19.2+ / Fabric API\n2. 放入 `mods/` 目录，并安装 Hex Casting `0.12.0-devel-pre-64` 与 PAUCAL `0.7.1-pre-27+1.21.1`。\n\n### 注意\n\n- **暂未发布到 Modrinth**，仅通过 GitHub Release 分发。\n- Hex Casting 0.12 仍处于 devel 预发布阶段，上游 API 可能继续变动。\n\n---\n\n## English\n\nThis is the **first Minecraft 1.21.1 release of MieHex:Revolution**, shipping both NeoForge and Fabric jars.\n\n### What's in this release\n\n- Ported to Minecraft 1.21.1 / Hex Casting `0.12.0-devel-pre-64`\n- Adapted to the Hex Casting 0.12 `CastingImage` change: arbitrary `userData` was removed; per-cast imports and the raw-pattern flag are now stored via `ImageComponentType` components\n- Requires PAUCAL `0.7.1-pre-27+1.21.1`\n- Architectury multi-platform layout (common + neoforge + fabric)\n- Cloth Config 15.0.140 for configuration on both loaders\n- NeoForge requires Kotlin for Forge and Caelus (Hex Casting dependencies)\n\n### Installation\n\n1. Pick the jar for your loader:\n   - `miehex_revolution-neoforge-1.21.1-1.0.4+1.21.1.jar` → NeoForge 21.1.x\n   - `miehex_revolution-fabric-1.21.1-1.0.4+1.21.1.jar` → Fabric Loader 0.19.2+ / Fabric API\n2. Drop it into `mods/` alongside Hex Casting `0.12.0-devel-pre-64` and PAUCAL `0.7.1-pre-27+1.21.1`.\n\n### Notes\n\n- **Not published to Modrinth yet** — GitHub Releases only.\n- Hex Casting 0.12 is still a devel pre-release; upstream APIs may keep changing."
		}
